{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","goal":"Prepare an evidence-limited inspection handoff. The numerical acceptance interval is [12.48,12.52] mm, inclusive. Interval inclusion is arithmetic only, not physical validation.","ops":{"fields":"Return a compact JSON array of strings containing the reference's length, uncertainty, n, method, basis, physical_validation, in that order, preserving field values exactly.","bounds":"Return a compact JSON array [length-uncertainty,length+uncertainty], each formatted as a string with two decimal places and unit mm. If uncertainty is unknown, return unknown.","unk":"Return a compact JSON array of field names whose values are unknown, in this order: uncertainty, method, basis.","inside":"Return inside if the entire length +/- uncertainty interval lies within the goal's acceptance interval; outside otherwise. If uncertainty is unknown, return unknown."},"refs":{"r1":"length=12.46 mm; uncertainty=0.02 mm; n=4; method=unknown; basis=expanded; physical_validation=not_claimed","r2":"length=12.55 mm; uncertainty=0.03 mm; n=6; method=micrometer; basis=unknown; physical_validation=not_claimed","r3":"length=12.42 mm; uncertainty=0.03 mm; n=6; method=micrometer; basis=unknown; physical_validation=not_claimed","r4":"length=12.56 mm; uncertainty=0.03 mm; n=2; method=caliper; basis=unknown; physical_validation=not_claimed","r5":"length=12.48 mm; uncertainty=0.01 mm; n=5; method=micrometer; basis=resolution; physical_validation=not_claimed","r6":"length=12.54 mm; uncertainty=unknown; n=2; method=unknown; basis=unknown; physical_validation=not_claimed","r7":"length=12.57 mm; uncertainty=0.01 mm; n=4; method=unknown; basis=expanded; physical_validation=not_claimed","r8":"length=12.46 mm; uncertainty=0.02 mm; n=3; method=unknown; basis=expanded; physical_validation=not_claimed","r9":"length=12.41 mm; uncertainty=0.02 mm; n=4; method=unknown; basis=resolution; physical_validation=not_claimed","r10":"length=12.40 mm; uncertainty=unknown; n=3; method=caliper